{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14738","headline":"送李尚书郎君昆季侍从归觐滑州 · 卢纶","name":"送李尚书郎君昆季侍从归觐滑州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"凤雏联翼美王孙，彩服戎装拟塞垣。\n金鼎对筵调野膳，玉鞭齐骑引行轩。\n冰河一曲旌旗满，墨诏千封雨露繁。\n更说务农能罢战，敢持謌颂庆晨昏。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢纶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14738.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14738","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}